# Credential Dumping Tools Service Execution - System | T1003.001, T1003.002, T1003.004, T1003.005, T1003.006, T1569.002 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/builtin/system/service_control_manager/win_system_mal_creddumper.yml
source="WinEventLog:System" Provider_Name="Service Control Manager" EventCode=7045 (ImagePath IN ("*cachedump*", "*dumpsvc*", "*fgexec*", "*gsecdump*", "*mimidrv*", "*pwdump*", "*servpw*"))
